<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Our Team | MoonTea Coffee</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Roboto&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="member.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>MoonTea Coffee</h1>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="home.html">Home</a>
      <a href="menu.html">Menu</a>
      <a href="about.html">About Us</a>
      <a href="member.html">Members</a>
      <a href="portfolio.html">Team Portfolio</a>
    </nav>
    <button id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">🌙 Toggle Theme</button>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="team-hero fade-in">
      <h2>Meet Our Team</h2>
      <p>Passionate people behind every cup of tea and coffee.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="team-container">
      <div class="team-card fade-in" data-role="Founder & Head Barista">
        <img src="member1.jpg" alt="Jane Moon - Founder">
        <h3>Jane Moon</h3>
        <p>Founder & Head Barista</p>
        <button class="details-btn">View Contribution</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Jane started MoonTea Coffee with a dream to blend tradition and creativity in every sip. She designed the brand theme and developed the homepage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card fade-in" data-role="Tea Specialist">
        <img src="member2.jpg" alt="Ken Tan - Tea Specialist">
        <h3>Ken Tan</h3>
        <p>Tea Specialist</p>
        <button class="details-btn">View Contribution</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Ken curates artisan teas from around the world. He implemented the menu page and catalogue filter/search feature.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card fade-in" data-role="Pastry Chef">
        <img src="member3.jpg" alt="Amira Lee - Pastry Chef">
        <h3>Amira Lee</h3>
        <p>Pastry Chef</p>
        <button class="details-btn">View Contribution</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Amira crafts seasonal pastries and designed the review module. She also contributed to accessibility testing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 MoonTea Coffee. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
